    "detailed_description": "Phillip is a police officer from a city in the interior and finds himself in a desperate situation: his daughter has been kidnapped. After a few hours Phillip receives an anonymous email saying he has information about his daughter and an address.<br />\r\nPhillip quickly went to the location and began looking for Amanda (his daughter). In this search, Phillip discovers that it is a sect that worships a goddess and kidnaps children with rare blood for experiments, in addition to using magic and beings from another world as part of their arsenal.<br />\r\nTake on the role of Phillip in this light action/horror FPS. Discover the history of the sect and its motives, send bullets at your enemies, solve small puzzles, explore and strengthen your player's soul to fight stronger enemies.<br />\r\nUse stealth mode when necessary, or try your luck at firing shots even with limited ammo.",
    "about_the_game": "Phillip is a police officer from a city in the interior and finds himself in a desperate situation: his daughter has been kidnapped. After a few hours Phillip receives an anonymous email saying he has information about his daughter and an address.<br />\r\nPhillip quickly went to the location and began looking for Amanda (his daughter). In this search, Phillip discovers that it is a sect that worships a goddess and kidnaps children with rare blood for experiments, in addition to using magic and beings from another world as part of their arsenal.<br />\r\nTake on the role of Phillip in this light action/horror FPS. Discover the history of the sect and its motives, send bullets at your enemies, solve small puzzles, explore and strengthen your player's soul to fight stronger enemies.<br />\r\nUse stealth mode when necessary, or try your luck at firing shots even with limited ammo.",
    "short_description": "Take on the role of Phillip in this light action/horror FPS. They kidnapped your daughter, SAVE HER. Aim, shoot, run, jump, defend yourself. Do everything you can to stay alive, explore the area and complete the objective.",
